alse,"description":""},{"id":1326067509,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI2MDY3NTA5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/labels/area/rest-client","name":"area/rest-client","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/77","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/77","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/77/labels","id":5711101,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTcxMTEwMQ==","number":77,"title":"1.8.0.CR1","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":185,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-07-29T10:09:58Z","updated_at":"2021-02-26T11:37:53Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-09-02T19:17:47Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2020-08-17T17:40:22Z","updated_at":"2020-08-27T10:59:02Z","closed_at":"2020-08-27T10:58:51Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nA RESTEasy deployment is only produced if something with a `@Path` is found:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/69ba3184ecd511fe7232ad6c4a852db6399baa2e/extensions/resteasy-server-common/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/resteasy/server/common/deployment/ResteasyServerCommonProcessor.java#L205-L208\r\n\r\nThis works fine for most cases. There is one case where this doesn't work:\r\n\r\nIf we have a Quarkus app, using a simple `ClientBuilder.newClient()`, annotated Providers are not automatically registered with the client, because the RESTEasy deployment was not initialized:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/73d39594b469d31240bcc2dc1fca2121f5bcdf9e/extensions/resteasy/runtime/src/main/java/io/quarkus/resteasy/runtime/standalone/ResteasyStandaloneRecorder.java#L68-L74\r\n\r\nWhich causes the Providers to not being registed with the client.\r\n\r\nIf we add a simple endpoint or even a dummy rest client interface with `@Path`, it works!\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nConsistent behaviour of Providers with `ClientBuilder.newClient()` independent of other classes in the application.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nProviders are only registered if a `@Path` class exists in the application.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n- Quarkus version or git rev: 1.7.0.Final\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nProviders can still be registered manually in the `ClientBuilder` to workaround this issue. Also RESTEasy is clear regarding Providers registration and the Client: https://docs.jboss.org/resteasy/docs/3.7.0.Final/userguide/html/Client_Providers_With_Provider_Annotation.html\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11424/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11424/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}